<title>TAIWAN: China Steel July-March pre-tax down.</title>
<headline>China Steel July-March pre-tax down.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to March 1997</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover			     63,392  vs  65,596</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     12,158  vs  13,716</p>
<p>NOTE - China Steel Corp is Taiwan's largest steel maker. The company, previoulsy state-run, was privatised in April 1995.</p>
<p>-- Taipei newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
